        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 24,
        "headingId": 372,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>GA10.3 &amp; XH6ZD0 Deep ovarian endometriosis &amp; Endometrioid adenoma NOS</p>\r\n<p>2F32.Y &amp; XH1CX5 Other specified benign neoplasm of ovary &amp; Endometrioid adenofibroma NOS</p>\r\n",
